WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:10.800
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:10.980
It must come in handy being able to sleep anywhere, at any time.

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:14.350
Bon bon chocolats... Yum...

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:16.820
She's eating even in her dreams!

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:20.330
Little piggy here isn't even a tad bit concerned!

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:22.980
Macarons...

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:24.060
I'm stuffed...

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:26.830
And we've got two more piglets over here!

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:28.750
I can smell the ocean.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:32.690
It was a long journey from Paris, but we're almost there.

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:38.880
Good morning...

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:41.010
Huh? Where am I?

00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:43.640
Sheesh... Look over there.

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:47.360
That's Mont Saint-Michel!

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:57.150
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:57.150
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.910
OP sequence

