chansu no tobira aketa toki kara kibun joujou ↑ ↑

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:13.190
Since I opened the door of chance, my mood lifted.

00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:17.160
youkoso suiitsu no oukoku he

00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:17.160
Welcome to the Kingdom of Sweets.

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:18.070
Bon appétit!

00:01:18.070 --> 00:01:25.460
hajimehane, hetappi demo megezu ni hibishoujin<i>!</i>

00:01:18.070 --> 00:01:25.460
Though I was terrible at the beginning, I was diligent everyday<i>!</i>

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:28.130
「makeruna<i>! atashi」</i>

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:28.130
「I won't lose<i>!</i> I said to myself」

00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:29.090
Courage!

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:35.870
My dream migakeba hikaru takaramono

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:35.870
My dream when polished is a shining treasure.

00:01:35.870 --> 00:01:38.640
fairy chikara kashite<i>!</i>

00:01:35.870 --> 00:01:38.640
Fairy, lend me your strength<i>!</i>

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:44.020
shifon, se shibon, juré, bonjuuru, hatsuratsu furuutsu, raburii made go!

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:44.020
Chiffon, C'est si bon, Gelée, Bonjour, Lively fruits, Lovely made go!

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:50.110
nakitaku natte mo egao ni nareru mahou

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:50.110
Even if you cry, there is magic that can make you smile.

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:55.320
「oishii<i>!」 wo tsukurutte omoikkiri tanoshii ne</i>

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:55.320
「Delicious<i>!</i>」 and making it wholeheartedly is fun.

00:01:55.320 --> 00:02:01.370
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:01:55.320 --> 00:02:01.370
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:06.710
shiawase wo ageru yo yumeiro no pâtishièeru<i>!!</i>

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:06.710
I'll give happiness to you, the dream-coloured Pâtissière<i>!!</i>

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:11.250
ichigo furejie & furanbowaazu, hapihapi makaron, fun fun

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:11.250
Strawberry Fraisier & Framboise, happy happy Macaron, fun, fun

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:13.420
yume ni eeru<i>!</i>

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:13.420
Get them in our dreams<i>!</i>

00:02:13.710 --> 00:02:17.920
Presented by Wasurenai-subs

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:20.260
It's a good morning.

00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:25.740
Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:31.130
Wow, look at all the people here!

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:34.620
Mont Saint-Michel is a world famous tourist spot, after all.

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:36.850
It's a monastery built on a small island,

00:02:36.850 --> 00:02:39.490
where during high-tide it gets surrounded by the ocean,

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:41.690
and looks like it's floating on the sea.

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:45.940
There's a bridge built now, so you can cross over at any time.

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:50.360
But in the past there were pilgrims that lost their lives swallowed up in the waves.

00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:52.720
Huh? Where's Amano-san?

00:02:52.720 --> 00:02:57.060
Looky look! It's Mont Saint-Michel's famous butter cookies!

00:02:57.060 --> 00:02:59.240
Do you <i>ever</i> stop eating?

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:03.590
But you've got to eat these if you come to Mont Saint-Michel, right?

00:03:05.420 --> 00:03:06.430
What's that?

00:03:06.430 --> 00:03:07.170
A helicopter?

00:03:09.170 --> 00:03:14.330
Makoto-kuuuun!

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:12.480
Ojou!

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:23.850
You're such a meanie. You could at least greet me!

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:26.440
If you want to greet me, then please don't hug me!

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:31.330
Amano Ichigo, you're such a commoner getting excited over some butter cookies.

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:33.160
But they're yummy!

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:36.470
You're the only person who is simple enough to enjoy them.

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:37.650
Oh, what an embarrassment!

00:03:39.770 --> 00:03:42.090
The ocean? Is this the ocean?

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:43.650
Yes, it's the ocean, José!

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:44.910
It's the honest to goodness ocean!

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:48.040
Hey, people... Why are you getting so excited about the ocean?

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:50.890
This is our first time to the ocean.

00:03:50.890 --> 00:03:51.370
Yeah!

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:56.590
Spain

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:56.590
France

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:56.590
Principality of Andorra

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:56.590
Switzerland

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:56.590
Italy

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:56.590
The Principality of Andorra is in the middle of the Pyrenees mountains, so we've never seen it.

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:57.680
Wow!

00:03:57.680 --> 00:03:59.090
It's incredible!

00:03:58.150 --> 00:03:59.090
¡Olé!

00:03:59.910 --> 00:04:01.640
They're<i> the real commoners.</i>

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:05.320
So, why are you all here?

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:06.720
We were invited!

00:04:07.770 --> 00:04:09.190
That's...

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:10.850
As were we.

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:15.940
It's an invitation to a masked ball held here at Mont Saint-Michel at 8 PM.

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:18.090
It's not written who sent it.

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:21.820
But the envelope has the seal of St. Marie Academy on it.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:23.450
I see you're all here.

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:24.950
Team Ichigo.

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:26.400
Y-Yes?

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:27.640
Team Koshiro.

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:28.490
Who are you?

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:30.290
Follow me, everyone.

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:37.480
recipe 44

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:37.480
Chocolate Princess

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:41.010
Are we still climbing?

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:45.510
Hey... How much farther is it?

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:53.680
Welcome to Mont Saint-Michel.

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:54.170
Henri-sensei!

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:55.810
I thank you for your long journey.

00:04:56.540 --> 00:04:58.760
So you are the one who sent the invitation?

00:04:58.760 --> 00:05:01.000
Yes, that's right.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:06.240
You didn't call both teams out here just for some party, did you?

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:10.330
Today, here, we will hold the semifinals of the World Cake Grand Prix.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.830
I figured as much.

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:14.040
What is the subject?

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:17.380
You will make a party dress out of chocolate.

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:19.570
A dress?

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:22.250
You have until the clock strikes 8, tonight.

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:25.760
Until the bell is finished tolling at the start of tonight's ball.

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:28.820
A large number of guests will be coming to this ball.

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:31.800
Please make dresses that everyone can enjoy.

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:36.140
I get the chocolate part, but a dress?

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:37.660
This isn't simple...

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:40.240
What should we do for a dress?

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:42.970
Now this is a job for me.

00:05:42.970 --> 00:05:48.690
As one who strives for perfect coordination of the body, food, and home, I have full confidence in my fashion sense.

00:05:48.690 --> 00:05:50.330
Leave the design to me!

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:53.510
A dress made out of chocolate! How romantic!

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:55.270
So, what should we do?

00:05:55.270 --> 00:05:57.690
I've got a ton of ideas.

00:05:57.690 --> 00:06:00.400
We'll leave the design of the dress to you two.

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:03.410
Andou, you and I will go out to buy chocolate.

00:06:03.410 --> 00:06:05.840
Right. We'll split up the work.

00:06:07.890 --> 00:06:13.640
Ojou-sama! That's the highest class hotel nearby, Normandie!

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:18.080
It's famous for its two-star cuisine, and has a wonderful kitchen!

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:19.900
That will do excellently. Make that our destination.

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:29.410
This kitchen belongs to Team Koshiro for the day!

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:32.280
As per our discussions with the hotel's management,

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:34.450
we have a signed contractual agreement.

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:36.100
See, here it is!

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:37.860
Oh, Papa? It's Miya.

00:06:37.860 --> 00:06:40.160
We're here in Hotel Normandie, however...

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:43.640
It'd be great if we could get some of the best chocolate in the entire world.

00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:47.140
I figured you'd say something like that, so I've already made arrangements.

00:06:47.140 --> 00:06:52.620
I'm one of the judges, so I happen to know that the subject is a chocolate dress!

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:54.900
It's the highest quality couverture.

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:56.390
Use it to your heart's content!

00:06:56.710 --> 00:06:59.690
I can always count on you, Papa! You're the best!

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:01.060
See you tonight!

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:05.480
Now our victory is assured!

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:13.250
Amazing! This is just too amazing, Ojou-sama!

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:16.120
I'm moved beyond all words!

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:20.250
When José gets excited, he has a habit of charging like a bull.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.350
I'm moved as well!

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:27.010
Miguel starts to dance when he gets excited.

00:07:27.310 --> 00:07:29.100
Why are you so impressed?

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:33.720
We've never made sweets in such an incredible kitchen like this.

00:07:34.360 --> 00:07:40.390
The smallest campus of St. Marie Academy is in the Principality of Andorra.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:42.590
It's just one room in an apartment.

00:07:42.590 --> 00:07:44.490
And there's hardly any students, either!

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:46.450
Just the three of us.

00:07:46.450 --> 00:07:51.400
Once in a while a teacher would come part-time from the main campus in Paris or Spain.

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:53.640
But they'd always go right back...

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:57.150
We hardly had any equipment or ingredients for making sweets at all!

00:07:57.150 --> 00:08:00.040
So we were always doing part time jobs!

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:02.330
I worked as a bullfighter to raise money in Spain.

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:06.920
And I went to Spain as well, earning money as a traveling Flamenco Dancer!

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:09.140
And I herded sheep.

00:08:10.180 --> 00:08:12.950
But there was only so much we could do.

00:08:12.950 --> 00:08:17.600
Even if there were some sweets we wanted to make, we couldn't without proper ingredients!

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:20.980
Our Spirits lost their motivation and went to waste...

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:21.900
And it was then...

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:29.250
Our academy was bought by Château confectionery, and instantly...

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:32.660
We could use all the high quality ingredients we wanted!

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:35.160
And any tool we needed, we could get!

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:39.370
We became able to make sweets to our heart's content!

00:08:39.710 --> 00:08:43.680
And what's more, we were able to enter the World Cake Grand Prix we always looked up to!

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:46.330
Miya Ojou-sama is truly our saviour!

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:47.760
No, our goddess!

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:49.980
Thanks be upon you!

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:52.790
Yes, yes. Thank us all you want.

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:54.060
When the winner's announced, he'll be all mine...

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:54.890
Ojou-sama?

00:08:54.890 --> 00:08:55.640
Are you listening?

00:08:55.920 --> 00:08:57.400
Miya is busy right now!

00:08:57.400 --> 00:09:00.370
You guys can use all the ingredients you want.

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:03.240
Make a dress that is sure to beat Team Ichigo!

00:09:03.240 --> 00:09:04.090
Got it?

00:09:04.090 --> 00:09:04.640
Yeah!

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:08.610
I was thinking we should go with a Cinderella theme.

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:13.090
Cinderella... The wonderful story about eating a poison apple!

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:14.880
That's Snow White...

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:18.240
And what about eating a poison apple is wonderful?

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:23.250
Cinderella is a story about how a poor, hardworking girl finds happiness.

00:09:23.550 --> 00:09:29.550
Cinderella worked really hard, even though she was bullied by her step mother and sisters.

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:27.900
So, you will do the cleaning while we go to the ball.

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:29.550
That's right! That's right!

00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:32.710
Hey! Why am I playing the evil step mother?

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:35.260
And in the first place, why are you Cinderella, Cafe?

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:40.220
One day a Fairy Godmother appeared, and gave her a beautiful dress.

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:39.340
And there you go.

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:43.310
Yay! I'm the Fairy Godmother!

00:09:43.860 --> 00:09:48.870
Cinderella goes to a ball, and the Prince falls in love with her at first sight.

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:54.040
Finally, using a glass slipper to reunite, they get married and live happily ever after!

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:57.190
So, this is the design I've come up with.

00:09:57.190 --> 00:09:57.990
Awesome!

00:09:57.990 --> 00:09:58.820
It sure is!

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:00.790
That's going to be really difficult.

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:03.650
We have to make each rose out of chocolate.

00:10:03.650 --> 00:10:06.530
It'll take technique, and quite a lot of time.

00:10:06.530 --> 00:10:09.500
Well, I think the design is perfect, but...

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:10.710
What should we do?

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:13.630
If we don't finish it in time, we'll get points taken off.

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:14.960
Maybe we should lose some of the decorations...

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:16.140
No, we'll go with this.

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:18.850
I don't really know about dresses.

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:22.490
But you said the design was perfect, right? Then we're not changing it.

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:23.900
We'll go with this.

00:10:23.900 --> 00:10:26.540
I figured that's what you'd say, Kashino.

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:29.060
Then we'd better steel ourselves and get set.

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:30.360
Can everyone help?

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:31.940
Of course!

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:33.120
It's decided!

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:34.360
Let's all do our best!

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:35.910
Yeah!

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:54.950
Caramel, you have to stir faster or it'll harden!

00:10:54.950 --> 00:10:56.290
Okay!

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:59.450
Amano-san, why did you choose Cinderella as the theme?

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:01.650
It's a story I really love...

00:11:01.650 --> 00:11:06.120
Cinderella works through all her hardships, and eventually finds happiness.

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:07.850
It's a real happy ending, you know?

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:10.700
I'm sure you can become Cinderella, Ichigo-chan.

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:13.360
All girls are princesses at heart, after all.

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:16.590
No way, no way! I'm totally not the Cinderella type.

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:18.710
I think it suits you quite well.

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:21.740
Cinderella was a lowly servant at first.

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:26.830
Cinderella was a beautiful woman who the prince fell in love with at the ball, right?

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:29.330
Why are you imagining her like that?

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:33.380
I'd rather be the Fairy Godmother who helps Cinderella out.

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:34.240
Why?

00:11:34.240 --> 00:11:39.550
It's because the Fairy Godmother gave her such a pretty dress that she was able to meet the prince.

00:11:40.150 --> 00:11:46.520
I hope this dress makes the people who wear it and see it happy, just like that.

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:52.040
That's the same thing as being a pâtissière that makes people happy with sweets, I think!

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:54.760
This is our first big event, too!

00:11:54.760 --> 00:11:56.360
Let's do this with motivation!

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:57.280
Yeah!

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:05.300
You guys handle yourselves pretty well.

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:08.470
Not bad for folks who were too poor to make sweets.

00:12:08.470 --> 00:12:11.440
Even without any money, we studied really hard!

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:14.130
We love sweets just as much as anyone!

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:15.650
Satou, Shiotani.

00:12:15.650 --> 00:12:17.430
Are the other preparations complete?

00:12:17.430 --> 00:12:18.850
Yes, without delay!

00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:19.670
It's perfect!

00:12:20.890 --> 00:12:22.440
If I win tonight...

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:24.430
Points

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:24.430
Team
Koshiro

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:24.430
Team
Ichigo

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:25.060
Team Koshiro wins overwhelmingly!

00:12:26.020 --> 00:12:28.430
Makoto-kun, I've been waiting for this day!

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:31.010
Yes... So have I...

00:12:31.010 --> 00:12:32.440
Miya, marry me!

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:36.440
Everyone, we're getting married!

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:36.150
Miya ojou-sama
Kashino Makoto

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:36.150
congratulations
on the wedding!

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:38.120
Congratulations!

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:42.200
The second I win, I'll announce our marriage at Mont Saint-Michel!

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:45.740
Only 30 minutes left...

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:49.160
Finished.

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:51.040
We need to get the model to put it on.

00:12:51.390 --> 00:12:52.310
Model?

00:12:53.400 --> 00:12:56.530
Oh, no! We totally forgot to get someone to model the dress for us!

00:12:56.530 --> 00:12:57.930
What'll we do? Who'll wear it?

00:12:57.930 --> 00:12:59.260
Oh, we've got a model.

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:02.850
Me!?

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:06.150
No way, no way... I look terrible in a dress.

00:13:06.150 --> 00:13:10.350
Why not? The Fairy Godmother can be Cinderella once in a while.

00:13:11.190 --> 00:13:12.290
Kashino...

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:23.440
Judges, if you please.

00:13:26.880 --> 00:13:28.700
Everything is prepared.

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:30.040
Where is Team Ichigo?

00:13:30.040 --> 00:13:30.780
Not here yet.

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:33.830
We're gonna get married.

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:39.640
Oh, no! The bell!

00:13:39.640 --> 00:13:40.630
Hurry!

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:46.970
Ichigo-chan!

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:48.200
Are you okay?

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:48.760
Yeah...

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:50.020
Hurry!

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:57.270
The last toll of the bell...

00:13:59.900 --> 00:14:01.740
We've arrived!

00:14:01.740 --> 00:14:03.900
Unfortunately, you are too late!

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:06.570
Team Koshiro wins by forfeit!

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:07.650
Oh, no...

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:14.400
No. In Cinderella, the magic disappears only after the 12th ring of the bell dies out.

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:18.270
It was very close, but you barely made it.

00:14:20.090 --> 00:14:21.510
Thank you very much!

00:14:22.640 --> 00:14:24.050
Girl's got luck...

00:14:26.390 --> 00:14:36.520
Everyone, thank you very much for coming here during your busy schedules to the first semi-final match of St. Marie Academy's World Cake Grand Prix.

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:41.220
Before we begin the ball, please enjoy the chocolate dresses that our students have created.

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:44.700
First, we have Team Koshiro!

00:14:55.660 --> 00:15:00.400
Behold the beauty of Team Koshiro's chocolate dress!

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:04.940
It's huge!

00:15:04.940 --> 00:15:05.770
It's gorgeous!

00:15:05.770 --> 00:15:07.510
I've never seen a dress like that before!

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:11.600
Oh, but that's not all!

00:15:11.600 --> 00:15:12.530
Satou!

00:15:12.530 --> 00:15:13.270
Yes!

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:21.330
It's illuminated!

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:23.090
Won't the chocolate melt?

00:15:23.090 --> 00:15:24.920
No need to worry!

00:15:24.920 --> 00:15:26.860
These are LEDs!

00:15:27.140 --> 00:15:27.920
Bravo!

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:30.540
That is quite a novel dress.

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:33.560
But isn't using lights against the rules?

00:15:33.560 --> 00:15:36.510
As long as they used chocolate it's not a problem.

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:40.990
Isn't it a dynamic dress, worthy of the World Cake Grand Prix?

00:15:40.990 --> 00:15:43.250
You can't get more original than that!

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:45.590
Bravo, bravo!

00:15:46.190 --> 00:15:48.090
Come on. Time to go.

00:15:50.430 --> 00:15:51.390
Yeah.

00:15:51.390 --> 00:15:55.390
Then, next... Let's take a look at Team Ichigo's dress.

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:05.780
They're so many people...

00:16:06.390 --> 00:16:07.580
Everyone's looking...

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:08.470
Ichigo!

00:16:08.470 --> 00:16:09.330
Hey, Ichigo!

00:16:09.330 --> 00:16:12.550
Don't just stand there! You have to show off the dress!

00:16:12.550 --> 00:16:14.740
It's no use! She's too nervous to hear us!

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:16.470
She's frozen stiff...

00:16:19.360 --> 00:16:20.610
Hanabusa-kun...

00:16:20.610 --> 00:16:25.460
Relax, relax... You made it safely to the ball, so have fun.

00:16:31.140 --> 00:16:34.010
Don't worry. We're here with you.

00:16:35.150 --> 00:16:36.390
Andou-kun...

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:43.520
Kashino?

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:46.810
Your face is all tense, Cinderella.

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:48.760
You're the main character, so smile a little.

00:16:48.760 --> 00:16:53.550
And what about you? What kind of blank-faced prince is escorting Cinderella?

00:16:53.550 --> 00:16:55.240
This is the way I always look.

00:16:56.140 --> 00:16:57.780
You're one uncourteous prince...

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:00.120
Oh, quiet you.

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:21.370
Is that actually chocolate?

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:23.520
I can't believe the craftsmanship!

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:27.360
The use of chocolate sculpture in the chocolate crafts!

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:30.360
What a charmingly cute princess we have here!

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:38.790
The judges get five votes each, and each attendee gets one.

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:41.830
Please vote for which team you believe did best.

00:17:42.270 --> 00:17:45.490
We will now announce the results.

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:52.880
                      Team
Koshiro
Team
Ichigo

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:52.880
Judges          Attendees          Total

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:54.290
A tie?

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:03.140
We have an announcement. We will hold another semi-final match.

00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:06.950
Please enjoy this evening's masked ball.

00:18:11.250 --> 00:18:16.540
And this was such a perfect chance to get married to Makoto-kun immediately!

00:18:16.540 --> 00:18:19.490
Argh! Fine then! I'm going to show off my dress while dancing!

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:21.990
I'll be your partner, Miya Ojou-sama!

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:24.730
Leave the dancing to me, Miya Ojou-sama!

00:18:24.730 --> 00:18:26.710
I'd like to ask as well!

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:29.140
Hey you guys, back off!

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:31.930
We've never danced with our Miya Ojou-sama either!

00:18:31.930 --> 00:18:35.180
We've lived for our Miya Ojou-sama ever since we were children!

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:36.790
For her!

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:40.010
Makoto-kun! Makoto-kun!

00:18:41.190 --> 00:18:42.390
Found you!

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:43.520
Makoto-kun!

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:47.160
Let's dance together!

00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:51.280
Okay, of course Miya!

00:18:52.340 --> 00:18:53.250
Papa?

00:18:53.250 --> 00:18:58.410
To choose me for your first dance... You really are daddy's little sweet angel!

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:05.220
Oh? Where's Ichigo-chan?

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:06.660
Amano!

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:11.880
Umm, excuse me...

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:12.880
Could I please get...

00:19:24.830 --> 00:19:26.260
Umm...

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:30.900
Henri-sensei!

00:19:30.900 --> 00:19:37.430
Excuse me for that. I was afraid you and your wonderful dress might get crushed back there.

00:19:37.430 --> 00:19:38.590
Are you okay?

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:40.240
Yes...

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:41.240
I'm glad.

00:19:44.380 --> 00:19:46.910
I'm alone together with Henri-sensei!

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:49.930
There's so much I want to say, but...

00:19:51.570 --> 00:19:54.790
...the words aren't coming out.

00:19:57.220 --> 00:20:00.240
Princess, may I have this dance?

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:01.220
Yes!

00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:14.980
You've done well getting this far.

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:19.860
You, being a transfer student, I never expected you to participate in the Cake Grand Prix.

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:21.990
But no, you've exceeded my expectations!

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:23.570
But I...

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:26.040
I've still got so much to learn and...

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:30.810
So close!

00:20:30.810 --> 00:20:32.270
He's too close!

00:20:32.270 --> 00:20:33.730
Henri-sensei...

00:20:36.780 --> 00:20:41.580
Ichigo... Let us dance. For tonight is a ball!

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:43.210
Yes!

00:20:44.960 --> 00:20:47.050
Ichigo, there she is!

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:51.240
I thought she'd run off, but she's dancing carefree out here!

00:20:51.240 --> 00:20:53.690
Her partner is... Henri-sensei?

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:55.010
Look at them go.

00:20:55.010 --> 00:20:58.990
He's not just a master of sweets, he's also a master of dance!

00:20:58.990 --> 00:21:02.690
They're like a prince and princess!

00:21:02.690 --> 00:21:03.990
How wonderful...

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:08.530
What a terrible prince, snatching away our Cinderella.

